{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_173_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_173","textTraditional":"一、二十有四年。春，叔孫豹如晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_173_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_173","textTraditional":"二、仲孫羯帥師侵齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_173_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_173","textTraditional":"三、夏，楚子伐吳。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_173_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_173","textTraditional":"四、秋七月甲子朔，日有食之，既。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_173_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_173","textTraditional":"五、齊崔杼帥師伐莒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_173_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_173","textTraditional":"六、大水。八月癸巳朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_173_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_173","textTraditional":"七、公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾婁子、滕子、薛伯、〈木巳〉伯、小邾婁子于陳儀。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_173_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_173","textTraditional":"八、冬，楚子、蔡侯、陳侯、許男伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_173_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_173","textTraditional":"九、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_173_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_173","textTraditional":"十、陳鍼宜咎出奔楚。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_173_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_173","textTraditional":"十一、叔孫豹如京師。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_173_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_173","textTraditional":"十二、大饑。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}